-- issue #1253: control twin of rb.mdk with the ONE flipped variable -- its
-- record-form constructor is renamed MkTB (was MkT), so it no longer collides
-- with ra.mdk's MkT. Used by control.mdk to prove that record-form ctor
-- resolution and cross-module dispatch work fine when nothing is genuinely
-- ambiguous -- isolating the bug to the TRULY-AMBIGUOUS case main.mdk pins.
public export data TB = MkTB { fx : Int }
import ra.{Tag, tag}
export impl Tag TB where
  tag _ = "FROM-RB"
